node_modules/
dist/
analysis-reports/
config.json
# The per-install control-plane capability token. It normally lives in ~/.llm-relay/, but the
# token directory is resolved from the CONFIG's own path — so `llm-relay --config ./config.json`
# run inside this checkout mints one right here, beside the config.json already ignored above.
# A 256-bit capability that `git add -A` would happily stage.
control-token
*.local.json
*.log
# /audit-code run output — multi-MB reports regenerated per run. Durable conclusions
# belong in docs/, never in the raw artifacts. Same reasoning as analysis-reports/.
.audit-tools/
.audit-code/
.remediate-code/
.claude/verify-green/
# /start-lap writes it, /closeout consumes and deletes it — machine-lap state, never shipped.
.claude/lap-start.json
# A live pointer the harness overwrites so a session can compact — same class as the file above:
# session state, not source. Committing it would add churn on every lap and ship nothing useful.
.claude/compaction-checkpoint.md
